---
// CDC and Debezium Transactional Outbox Pipeline Diagram
---

<figure class="cdc-diagram" aria-labelledby="cdc-caption">
  <svg
    class="cdc-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="cdc-title cdc-desc"
  >
    <title id="cdc-title">CDC 變更資料擷取與 Debezium Outbox 串流拓撲</title>
    <desc id="cdc-desc">
      展示從 RDBMS 交易、Transactional Outbox 模式、Debezium 解析 Binlog/WAL，到
      Kafka Connect 分發至快取失效與即時資料湖的完整管線。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="cdc-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="cdc-diagram__arrow-head"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Stage 1: RDBMS & Outbox Table -->
    <g class="cdc-diagram__card" transform="translate(30, 40)">
      <rect width="260" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="cdc-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26"
        >ACID LOCAL TRANSACTION</text
      >
      <text class="cdc-diagram__title" x="18" y="54">業務 DB 與 Outbox 表</text>

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="75"
          rx="6"
          class="cdc-diagram__subcard cdc-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text
          class="cdc-diagram__header cdc-diagram__header--blue"
          x="12"
          y="22">業務表 (orders / users)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 執行核心業務寫入</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__code" x="12" y="62"
          >INSERT INTO orders ...;</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 160)">
        <rect
          width="224"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="cdc-diagram__subcard cdc-diagram__subcard--orange"></rect>
        <text
          class="cdc-diagram__header cdc-diagram__header--orange"
          x="12"
          y="22">發件匣表 (outbox_table)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 同一 ACID 交易內寫入事件</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__code" x="12" y="62"
          >INSERT INTO outbox (id,</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__code" x="12" y="76">
          aggregatetype, payload);</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 255)">
        <rect width="224" height="90" rx="6" class="cdc-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__header" x="12" y="22"
          >底層日誌 (WAL / Binlog)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• MySQL Binlog (ROW format)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• Postgres WAL (Logical pgoutput)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="82"
          >• 零侵入、順序寫入、精確持久</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Stage 2: Debezium & Kafka Connect -->
    <g class="cdc-diagram__card" transform="translate(340, 40)">
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="cdc-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26">LOG-BASED CDC ENGINE</text>
      <text class="cdc-diagram__title" x="18" y="54">Debezium 捕獲與轉換</text>

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="cdc-diagram__subcard cdc-diagram__subcard--red"></rect>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__header cdc-diagram__header--red" x="12" y="22"
          >Debezium Connector</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 模擬從庫 (Replication Client)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 實時讀取解析日誌位移 (Offset)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="82"
          >• 全量 Snapshot + 增量 Streaming</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 170)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="cdc-diagram__subcard cdc-diagram__subcard--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="cdc-diagram__header cdc-diagram__header--purple"
          x="12"
          y="22">SMT 事件轉換 (Transform)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• Outbox Event Router 路由</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 移除包裝層，扁平化 Payload</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="82"
          >• 動態指定 Target Kafka Topic</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 265)">
        <rect width="234" height="80" rx="6" class="cdc-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="cdc-diagram__header" x="12" y="22"
          >Kafka Connect Runtime</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 分散式高可用節點叢集</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• 自動容錯與 Offset 狀態管理</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Stage 3: Downstream Consumers & Data Lake -->
    <g class="cdc-diagram__card" transform="translate(660, 40)">
      <rect width="270" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="cdc-diagram__badge" x="18" y="26">DOWNSTREAM STREAMING</text>
      <text class="cdc-diagram__title" x="18" y="54">下游消費與資料湖同步</text>

      <g transform="translate(18, 75)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="cdc-diagram__subcard cdc-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text
          class="cdc-diagram__header cdc-diagram__header--gold"
          x="12"
          y="22">Apache Kafka Cluster</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 分區 Key = Aggregate ID 保障順序</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• acks=all 冪等發送，零遺失</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 165)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="cdc-diagram__subcard cdc-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text
          class="cdc-diagram__header cdc-diagram__header--teal"
          x="12"
          y="22">即時微服務與快取失效</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• 異步驅動領域事件 (Event-Driven)</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• Redis / Memcached 主動失效</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="82"
          >• 搜尋引擎 Elasticsearch 即時同步</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(18, 260)">
        <rect
          width="234"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="cdc-diagram__subcard cdc-diagram__subcard--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="cdc-diagram__header cdc-diagram__header--purple"
          x="12"
          y="22">即時 OLAP / 資料湖</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="44"
          >• ClickHouse / StarRocks 數倉</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="64"
          >• Apache Iceberg / Hudi 湖倉</text
        >
        <text class="cdc-diagram__subdesc" x="12" y="82"
          >• 秒級端到端即時分析 (RT-ETL)</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Connecting Arrows -->
    <path
      d="M 290 220 L 330 220"
      class="cdc-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#cdc-arrow)"></path>
    <path
      d="M 610 220 L 650 220"
      class="cdc-diagram__flow-line"
      marker-end="url(#cdc-arrow)"></path>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <div class="cdc-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="cdc-mobile-card cdc-mobile-card--orange">
      <span class="cdc-mobile-badge cdc-mobile-badge--orange"
        >STEP 1: OUTBOX PATTERN</span
      >
      <h4>業務資料庫與 Outbox 表</h4>
      <p>
        業務變更與 Outbox 事件在同一 ACID
        本地交易內寫入，徹底解決雙寫失敗與資料不一致。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cdc-mobile-arrow">↓ 讀取 WAL / Binlog 日誌</div>

    <div class="cdc-mobile-card cdc-mobile-card--red">
      <span class="cdc-mobile-badge cdc-mobile-badge--red"
        >STEP 2: DEBEZIUM CDC</span
      >
      <h4>Debezium 引擎與 Kafka Connect</h4>
      <p>
        模擬 Replica 串流讀取日誌，透過 SMT 轉換扁平化事件並推送到對應 Kafka
        Topics。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="cdc-mobile-arrow">↓ 串流分發與即時消費</div>

    <div class="cdc-mobile-card cdc-mobile-card--teal">
      <span class="cdc-mobile-badge cdc-mobile-badge--teal"
        >STEP 3: STREAMING SINK</span
      >
      <h4>微服務、快取失效與資料湖</h4>
      <p>
        觸發 Redis 快取主動失效、ES 檢索同步，並將巨量資料即時寫入 ClickHouse /
        Iceberg。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="cdc-caption" class="cdc-diagram__caption">
    圖 3：CDC 變更資料擷取、Transactional Outbox 模式與 Debezium 即時串流架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .cdc-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #64748b);
  }

  .cdc-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--color-bg-surface, #f8fafc);
    stroke: var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(.dark) .cdc-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #0f172a;
    stroke: #1e293b;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__badge {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: #64748b;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  :global(.dark) .cdc-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__title {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--color-text-main, #0f172a);
  }

  :global(.dark) .cdc-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .cdc-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }

  :global(.dark) .cdc-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #1e293b;
    stroke: #334155;
  }

